ass=\"elementor-element elementor-element-50813e10 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"50813e10\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Contact Us For Consultation</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-eaef0b8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"13297\" data-id=\"eaef0b8\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2d76f34f\" data-eae-slider=\"24643\" data-id=\"2d76f34f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-14132bf5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"14132bf5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Choose Our Trusted Arvada Child Custody Attorneys?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7dfeea23 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7dfeea23\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Child custody matters hold immense significance in divorce cases. These often become points of contention between parents who seek to protect their parental rights and maintain a meaningful relationship with their children. At our law firm, our child custody attorneys in Arvada, CO understand the legal and emotional complexities inherent in such cases. We are committed to providing comprehensive support to help you overcome obstacles and achieve outcomes that prioritize your child&#8217;s well-being.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When it comes to child custody, trust our experienced Arvada child custody attorneys to guide you through the process with care and expertise.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b47e573 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6b47e573\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Child Custody Lawyers in Arvada, CO\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46ba02ca elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"46ba02ca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/colorado/attorneys/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Drake Law Firm</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we offer dedicated </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/family-law/child-custody/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">legal representation in child custody matters</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Our attorneys are well-versed in the unique challenges and intricacies of child custody cases in Arvada, and we strive to provide compassionate guidance to help you navigate through this complex area of law. If you require assistance with child custody disputes, we are here to help. Contact our Arvada child custody lawyers today to explore your options.</span></p><h2 class=\"chldcstdy\">Types of Child Custody in Colorado</h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Understanding the different types of child custody arrangements is crucial when approaching child custody matters. In Colorado, child custody can be divided into two main categories:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Physical Custody: This refers to where the child primarily resides. Parents living in close proximity often opt for joint physical custody, allowing the child to spend significant time with each parent. However, if parents live further apart or face challenges due to different school districts, a suitable physical custody plan can be devised to ensure the child maintains a meaningful relationship with both parents.</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Legal Custody: Legal custody involves decision-making authority for the child&#8217;s well-being, including choices related to education, healthcare, and religious upbringing. Joint legal custody is typically preferred, enabling both parents to have a say in important decisions affecting their child&#8217;s life, even if one parent has primary physical custody.</span></li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-40d973c