ata-id=\"dd64025\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Can you modify child custody?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-003c51d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"003c51d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Modifying child custody agreements can be challenging due to the courts generally preferring to maintain the existing agreement, unless specific circumstances warrant a change. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">There are situations where modifications may be possible. For example, if the other parent has a history of abuse or has been convicted of criminal activity, it may be possible to seek a modification. Similarly, if one parent relocates a significant distance away or becomes unable to provide proper care for the child due to illness, a modification might be considered. It is important to consult with an experienced family law attorney to evaluate your unique circumstances and determine the feasibility of seeking a modification in your child custody agreement.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you believe that the existing child custody arrangement is no longer in your child&#8217;s best interests, our Arvada child custody attorneys can assist you in seeking a modification.</span></p><h2>Contact Us Today</h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are facing child custody challenges in Arvada, CO, The Drake Law Firm is here to provide you with reliable legal support. Our compassionate child custody attorneys have the expertise and commitment to guide you through the process, protect your parental rights, and prioritize your child&#8217;s well-being. Contact us today to </span><a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">schedule a consultation</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e47725a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"96344\" data-id=\"e47725a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-91d1113\" data-eae-slider=\"5747\" data-id=\"91d1113\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c737038 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"c737038\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t"
